# Scheduler crontab (supercronic). Times are Europe/Warsaw: TZ is set on the scheduler container.
# The scheduler only enqueues jobs; the worker executes them one at a time. The one exception is the daily
# `dclh oauth purge` below: it only deletes expired rows, so it cannot overlap a job.
#
# Phase 0: weekly live check of every source. It doubles as the weekly live smoke test (brief section 10)
# and only reports; it never blocks anything. From Phase 2 the full weekly run is added here (Mon 05:00).
0 5 * * 1 dclh enqueue discover --payload '{"ran_from": "scheduler"}'

# Nightly search (Warsaw time): queue the 8 powiats attempted longest ago. Each search job is skipped if it
# starts after 05:00, so the night window closes on its own. Needs the `prg` snapshot (lists the powiats).
# Priority powiats come from the list saved in the Powiaty tab (table powiat_priority), not from here.
0 1 * * * dclh enqueue plan_searches --payload '{"limit": 8, "window_end_hour": 5}'

# Land prices: on the 1st at 10:00 queue one RCN import per powiat of the AOI (outside the 01:00-05:00 search
# window). Each import is its own job, so a slow or failing powiat does not hold up the others.
0 10 1 * * dclh enqueue import_rcn --payload '{"all": true}'

# Claude connector: drop expired OAuth requests, codes and tokens, and clients that hold no token.
30 4 * * * dclh oauth purge
